<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Results of 1-shot segmentation learning on PASCAL-<math id="Sx4.T1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>i</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5^{i}</annotation></semantics></math> using mIoU (%) evaluation metric before and after applying our method on BAM and HDMNet. Bold indicates the best performance. <math id="Sx4.T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math>: Reproduced following the official configuration with 1,000 episodes.</figcaption>
</figure>
