<section id="Sx6" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Supplementary Material</h2>

<section id="Sx6.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="Sx6.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx6.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our approach builds upon ControlNet’s hyperparameters, while also introducing additional parameters to enhance the diversity of the synthetic images. The specific values of these hyperparameters are detailed in Table <a href="#Sx6.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Hyperparameters ‣ Supplementary Material ‣ Diffusion Synthesis: Data Factory with Minimal Human Effort Using VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
