<p id="Sx6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">CUDA version: release 11.8</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx6.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Sx6.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
