<p id="Sx6.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">CPU: Intel(R) Xeon(R) Silver 4314 CPU <math id="Sx6.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="@" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>@</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">@</annotation></semantics></math> 2.40GHz</p>
</div></li>
